{"title":"Glacier Warden","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 64 Rime Elemental that attacks with freeze (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/glacier-warden\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glacier-warden?lv=64\">Lv 64 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glacier-warden?lv=65\">Lv 65 <span>4</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/glacier-warden?lv=64\" title=\"Pick level 64\"><td><b>64</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>483</td><td>39.7</td><td>3,200</td><td class=\"muted\">1,449 · 55.6 · 9,600</td><td>3</td><td>in the wilds around -93, -1179</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/glacier-warden?lv=65\" title=\"Pick level 65\"><td><b>65</b></td><td>490</td><td>40.3</td><td>3,250</td><td class=\"muted\">1,470 · 56.4 · 9,750</td><td>4</td><td>in the wilds around 14, -1204</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-837.0px,409.6px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/2/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:-768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/2/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/3/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:-768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/3/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/4/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:-768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/4/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:-512px\"><i style=\"left:829.1px;top:-410.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:743.2px;top:-431.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:844.9px;top:-409.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:749.4px;top:-442.4px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 13, -1205 <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around -93, -1179 <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"glacier-warden\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Rime Elemental: <a href=\"#/monster/rime-shard\">Rime Shard</a> <span class=\"muted\">(61)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/rime-elemental\">Rime Elemental</a> <span class=\"muted\">(63)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/rime-warden-lord\">Warden Lord</a> <span class=\"muted\">(65)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/0222bae424e43d8b0985.svg\" alt=\"Glacier Warden\"></div><h3>Glacier Warden</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>64 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 64–65)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Rime Elemental</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>freeze · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>483</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>39.7</td></tr><